{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米询问耶和华"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和华啊，我与你争辩的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你显为义；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但有一件，我还要与你理论：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恶人的道路为何亨通呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大行诡诈的为何得安逸呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你栽培了他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也扎了根，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长大，而且结果。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的口是与你相近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心却与你远离。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，你晓得我，看见我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"察验我向你是怎样的心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你将他们拉出来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像将宰的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他们等候杀戮的日子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这地悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"通国的青草枯干，要到几时呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因其上居民的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牲畜和飞鸟都灭绝了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们曾说：他看不见我们的结局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：你若与步行的人同跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尚且觉累，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怎能与马赛跑呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在平安之地，虽然安稳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在约旦河边的丛林要怎样行呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为连你弟兄和你父家都用奸诈待你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们也在你后边大声喊叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽向你说好话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也不要信他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华为他的子民忧伤"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"我离了我的殿宇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撇弃我的产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将我心里所亲爱的交在她仇敌的手中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的产业向我如林中的狮子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她发声攻击我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我恨恶她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的产业向我岂如斑点的鸷鸟呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鸷鸟岂在她四围攻击她呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要去聚集田野的百兽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"带来吞吃吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"许多牧人毁坏我的葡萄园，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"践踏我的分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我美好的分变为荒凉的旷野。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们使地荒凉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地既荒凉，便向我悲哀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全地荒凉，因无人介意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"灭命的都来到旷野中一切净光的高处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的刀从地这边直到地那边尽行杀灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡有血气的都不得平安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们种的是麦子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是荆棘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"劳劳苦苦却毫无益处。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和华的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必为自己的土产羞愧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华对以色列邻国的许诺"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和华如此说：「一切恶邻，就是占据我使百姓以色列所承受产业的，我要将他们拔出本地，又要将犹大家从他们中间拔出来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["我拔出他们以后，我必转过来怜悯他们，把他们再带回来，各归本业，各归故土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["他们若殷勤学习我百姓的道，指着我的名起誓说：『我指着永生的耶和华起誓』，正如他们从前教我百姓指着巴力起誓，他们就必建立在我百姓中间。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他们若是不听，我必拔出那国，拔出而且毁灭。这是耶和华说的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}